  {
   "id": "te121",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 175,
   "y": 1560,
   "width": 1442.3999999999999,
   "height": 60,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "mBr4s9m0Gof4WKYs6yU4I",
   "seed": 598077321,
   "version": 52,
   "versionNonce": 517786236,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1791966877337,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Outgoing: the executor publishes each finished task's result once on car/{id}/result; the car's current zone and the anchor both receive it.\nTasks placed in a neighbour or the cloud go out through the data port (POST /tasks) with a notice on zone/{id}/work; boulders go to the cloud over wan_net.\nEvery 100 ms the zone publishes its state on zone/{id}/state. State lives here, in memory: MQTT only carries the updates.",
   "originalText": "Outgoing: the executor publishes each finished task's result once on car/{id}/result; the car's current zone and the anchor both receive it.\nTasks placed in a neighbour or the cloud go out through the data port (POST /tasks) with a notice on zone/{id}/work; boulders go to the cloud over wan_net.\nEvery 100 ms the zone publishes its state on zone/{id}/state. State lives here, in memory: MQTT only carries the updates.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": "b3Bu",
   "created": null,
   "labelPosition": null,
   "baseFontSize": null
  },
  {
   "id": "te122",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 175,
   "y": 1645,
   "width": 1015.52,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "mBr4s9m0Gof4WKYs6yU4I",
   "seed": 836682997,
   "version": 52,
   "versionNonce": 1112939260,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1791966877337,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Same code in fast mode: the MQTT client and data port are swapped for an in-process bus with modelled delays.",
   "originalText": "Same code in fast mode: the MQTT client and data port are swapped for an in-process bus with modelled delays.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": "b3Bv",
   "created": null,
   "labelPosition": null,
   "baseFontSize": null
  },
  {
   "id": "te123",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 175,
   "y": 1685,
   "width": 950.56,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "mBr4s9m0Gof4WKYs6yU4I",
   "seed": 120232147,
   "version": 52,
   "versionNonce": 995187580,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1791966877337,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Training never blocks decisions: inference and the online trainer run in separate workers; the trainer\nswaps in new weights between decisions.",
   "originalText": "Training never blocks decisions: inference and the online trainer run in separate workers; the trainer\nswaps in new weights between decisions.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": "b3Bx",
   "created": null,
   "labelPosition": null,
   "baseFontSize": null
  },
